    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n770" root="اسك" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِسْكٌ</span></b>  see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الإِسْكَتَانِ</span>.― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also The <i>side of the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْت</span> [i. e., of the <i>podex,</i> or of the <i>anus</i>]. (Sh,
TA.) [Hence,] one says of a man, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنَّمَا هُوَ إِسْكُ أَمَةٍ</span>,
meaning <i>He is but a stinking fellow.</i> (TA.)

